This paper establishes a novel Bessel type inequality utilizing the generalized Bessel function $Y_{
u}^{(c,d)}(z)$ within the Janowski class. Key Bessel type inequalities are derived for the modified Bessel function of the first kind $I_{
u}(z)$ and the modified Bessel function of the second kind $K_{
u}(z)$ in relation to $I_{0}(z)$ and $K_{0}(z)$. Subsequently, we determine the optimal sharp constants for these inequalities.
